message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Healthcare UC Automation: open-source E911 reconciliation for healthcare Cisco UC"
abstract: >-
  Open-source tooling and methodology supporting RAY BAUM's Act
  dispatchable-location compliance in healthcare unified communications.
  The E911 reconciliation engine evaluates location-data consistency
  by comparing facility-maintained location records, switch discovery,
  Cisco Emergency Responder and CUCM. It identifies discrepancies,
  generates proposed remediation actions and maintains an append-only
  audit history. The consistency metric measures data agreement rather
  than independently verified physical location accuracy or PSAP delivery.
type: software
